{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-86","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：截差无理线段","englishTitle":"To find the second apotome.","book":10,"number":86,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.86","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.86/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":86,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","contentId":"euclid-10-86","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f1f30a39a4fbbc2a4e4b571db22eecda22b097c3ae61a8b1e2ee62c7d8fc4bc","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-86.statement","euclid-10-86.construction.1","euclid-10-86.construction.2","euclid-10-86.proof.1","euclid-10-86.proof.2","euclid-10-86.proof.3","euclid-10-86.proof.4","euclid-10-86.proof.5","euclid-10-86.proof.6","euclid-10-86.construction.3","euclid-10-86.proof.7","euclid-10-86.proof.8","euclid-10-86.proof.9","euclid-10-86.proof.10","euclid-10-86.proof.11","euclid-10-86.conclusion","euclid-10-86.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-86.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e83a3be907b88395419413f148f6b5e4ee9e7c5fe554a60836e23d46d0f495da","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the second apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到第二个截差无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"958d4a23caf6912a41ffadeadff784ced1055cfbf76dba97d687e65937d9856f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a rational straight line A be set out, and GC commensurable in length with A; therefore GC is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出有理线段 A,GC 长度可公度和A;因此,GC是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"992438ebcfeaccddcbb108b5333b899a3fe3ec856f20f3018e30f0f7359e465a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two square numbers DE, EF be set out, and let their difference DF not be square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们的差数 DF 而不是正方形（相关点与线段：DE、EF）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61c21a4d894f2b46aa31601e6fc144c91162081cd16233f0ef109fcf99bd65aa","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let it be contrived that, as FD is to DE, so is the square on CG to the square on GB. [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,让我们来想想,FD对DE的比等于CG对FD对GB的比 [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"60a94905145ffd3e306624790f5f93f6d88358cd7a2c16d92e330a7a1a81197d","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on CG is commensurable with the square on GB. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CG正方形是可公度,GB是正方形。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59467971f8fcefd2b3617fc2b0122beac5103e40ae3c37d41f6bb4040683c2c4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on CG is rational; therefore the square on GB is also rational; therefore BG is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CG的正方形是有理;GB的正方形也是有理;BG是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9901b652ffbe63424022e25b8292da8f1594489d95b0484b347cde587e6e27b1","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the square on GC has not to the square on GB the ratio which a square number has to a square number, CG is incommensurable in length with GB. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于GC正方形与GB正方形之间,平方数平方数平方数GB不可公度GB不可公度GB。（相关点与线段：CG） [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b83f9267998de19857d9d9c85795b2eae19af29383627681989aeeb48f0c372","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore CG, GB are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore BC is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,CG,GB是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,BC是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"54bd8990425dd6f997fa5731b780d09c5ce387cce69b125eb587d95d8b30931e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a second apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第二个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":9,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12f43399c5c390ec780ed869f686d43238d4f72fc8d0ccba7d782488cfb83f0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the square on H be that by which the square on BG is greater than the square on GC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"H正方形BG正方形比GC正方形大"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df1355631ae6e41a25e7c60aa1be325aa6f822f16301ff17f8357b21f737eccf","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, as the square on BG is to the square on GC, so is the number ED to the number DF, therefore, convertendo, as the square on BG is to the square on H, so is DE to EF. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,BG对GC对正方形的比等于ED对DF的比,因此,转换后,BG对BG对正方形的比等于EF的比。（相关点与线段：H、DE） [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1cead06bcfba0401b412a9bc300cd12c147d2070cf7a69d3310b99ce99e40320","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And each of the numbers DE, EF is square; therefore the square on BG has to the square on H the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore BG is commensurable in length with H. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DE 与 EF 都是平方数，因此以 BG 为边作的正方形与以 H 为边作的正方形的面积之比，等于一个平方数与另一个平方数之比，所以 BG 与 H 在长度上可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3198b1eb1df1386d42b7a5f8d7492fe06dcc35494877527200c1f0b846b6ff7e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on BG is greater than the square on GC by the square on H; therefore the square on BG is greater than the square on GC by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with BG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG的正方形比GC的正方形还要多,H的正方形比H的正方形还要多,因此,BG的正方形比GC的正方形,长度可公度和BG线上的正方形都大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"36bb508688c707e3a722e49513643ff4c1335c0660c03f5780197084a853cb1d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And CG, the annex, is commensurable with the rational straight line A set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CG,附件,是可公度,有理线段 A已经确定。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b43aaf22e8f3940473e6f012c8c7ee8c18dffcec8c994d2b28064568fa3ed5b0","citations":["euclid-10-def-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BC is a second apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以BC是第二截差无理线段 [[X. Deff. III. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fd9fbdb32363e50bd8b09b0f632bac2b548015f40e72a4d1ffbaac92b076da64","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the second apotome BC has been found. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,发现了第二个截差无理线段 BC。 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-86.source","contentId":"euclid-10-86","revisionId":"euclid-10-86@raw-7f1f30a39a4fbbc2","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1dd9d0422c93501da4f2670a13c4dc42e0faa06ad315df58a044e5d4bc6b30cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.86/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.86\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-86:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-86","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-86.proof.1","euclid-10-86.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.86","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.86/","sourceLabel":"X. 6, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-86:euclid-10-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-86","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-86.proof.4","euclid-10-86.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.86","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.86/","sourceLabel":"X. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-86:euclid-10-73:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-86","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-86.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-73","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.86","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.pers